      "id": "b964b44a-df87-4297-9f15-ad4fcda76c34",
      "name": "API update methods",
      "description": {
        "content": "**POST** with a JSON body. Send **Content-Type: application/json** and the **API-Token** header. Creates update records that set current status (and key-result progress where applicable).",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
