            "name": "Update objective (create update)",
            "description": {
              "content": "## Base URL for this request\n\nSelect the server matching your Jira Cloud data residency from the **Servers** drop-down before making requests:\n\n- **Europe region:** https://eu.okr-ppm-prod.appfire.com\n- **Australia region:** https://au.okr-ppm-prod.appfire.com\n- **Canada region:** https://ca.okr-ppm-prod.appfire.com\n- **US / Everywhere else:** https://okr-ppm-prod.appfire.com\n\nCreates an update for the specified objective. **status** uses the same **displayed** labels as in the app: **NOT STARTED**, **ON TRACK**, **AT RISK**, **OFF TRACK** (action required). **description** is the text stored on that update. The new update becomes the objective's current status (and progress when the objective is manual).",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v2",
                "api-update",
                "objectives"
